        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the twenty-seventh year, in the first month, on the first day of the month, the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Son of man, Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon made his army labor hard against Tyre; every head was made bald and every shoulder was rubbed bare; yet neither he nor his army got anything from Tyre to pay for the labor that he had performed against it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I will give the land of Egypt to Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon; and he shall carry off its wealth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "multitude",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and despoil it and plunder it; and it shall be the wages for his army. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have given him the land of Egypt as his recompense for which he labored, because they worked for me, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
